00:22:43.710 --> 00:22:44.750
Mew!

00:23:07.220 --> 00:23:09.660
Now! Onto the next adventure!

00:23:09.660 --> 00:23:10.860
Go!

00:23:12.680 --> 00:23:15.050
Pokémon really are mysterious!

00:23:15.050 --> 00:23:19.270
Yeah! You think you know all about them,
but they can still surprise you!

00:23:19.270 --> 00:23:20.870
That’s what makes them so cool!

00:23:21.840 --> 00:23:22.880
Wait... Go!

00:23:22.880 --> 00:23:24.500
I-Is that...?

00:23:25.490 --> 00:23:27.050
Next time, on Pocket Monsters:

00:23:27.050 --> 00:23:29.420
Half a Numacraw.

00:23:29.420 --> 00:23:32.710
Half a Numacraw.
